 "notes": "Eight frames slower and one hitstop tier heavier; its running heavy barges through, which is how it opens a shield wall.\n\nLineage: scythe — A harvest scythe re-hafted for war: the blade tips downward and the spin ploughs rather than sweeps.\nMandatory slots present: 25/25. Total slots: 31.\nart.1/art.2 trigger: the schema's trigger block cannot express a chord, so the declared button is 'two_hand' with modifier hold/double_tap. The runtime conjunction is 'heavy pressed while two_hand is HELD' (art.1) and 'heavy HELD while two_hand is HELD' (art.2) — game/data/weapons/input-map.json is authoritative and machine-readable."
}
